# Journey 1 — the Daemons screen lists every managed daemon, and nothing on it
# reads "collecting…".
#
# Before: five rows. The MCP pool, the Hangar daemon and the Headroom proxy
# were real processes with no row, listed ad hoc in a System services panel
# that sat on "collecting…" whenever its separate async fetch wedged.
#
# Placeholders are filled in by scripts/record-daemons-journeys.sh.
Output tests/recordings/daemons-roster.gif
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Width 1500
Set Height 620
Set FontSize 15
Set Padding 12

Hide
Type "clear && HOME=__HOME__ AINB_HOME=__HOME__/.agents-in-a-box exec __AINB__ tui"
Enter
Sleep 12s
Show

Sleep 1s
Type "d"
Sleep 5s
